# Lake's build and dependency tree. `comparator/.lake/packages/mathlib` is a
# full Mathlib checkout --- it is a DEPENDENCY, resolved by
# `lake update` from the pinned tag in `lakefile.toml`, and must never enter
# this repository's history.
#
# `lake-manifest.json` is NOT ignored: it records the exact Mathlib revision the
# pair was checked against, which is the difference between "we matched Mathlib"
# and "we matched some Mathlib".
.lake/
